() Tj
T*
(1. Summary) Tj
T*
(Project Halcyon builds a delivery-route planner for the city of Port Verane.) Tj
T*
(Q3 ended with 82% of planned features done \(target was 75%\).) Tj
T*
(Total spend in Q3: EUR 418,000 against a budget of EUR 450,000.) Tj
T*
(The public beta launched on 14 September 2026 with 1,240 drivers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Team) Tj
T*
(Project lead: Dana Whitfield. Tech lead: Ravi Anand.) Tj
T*
(Design: Lucia Moreno. QA: Tomas Berg.) Tj
T*
(The team grew from 9 to 11 people in August.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Key results) Tj
T*
(- Average route time dropped from 47 minutes to 39 minutes \(-17%\).) Tj
T*
(- Fuel use per delivery fell by 12% in the beta group.) Tj
T*
(- App crash rate: 0.4% of sessions \(goal: below 0.5%\).) Tj
T*
(- Driver satisfaction score: 4.3 out of 5.) Tj
T*
ET
